OL,3,GNEWSAHate crime helpline on hand to
OL,4,Ahelp says council
OL,5,
OL,6,FVictims or witnesses of hate crime in
OL,7,FReading are being encouraged by its
OL,8,Fcouncil to use a confidential 24-hour
OL,9,Fhelpline.
OL,11,FCharity Stop Hate UK listens to
OL,12,Fpeople's experiences and gives
OL,13,Findependent support on 0800 138 1625.
OL,15,FIts use in Reading is funded by the
OL,16,FReading Community Safety Partnership
OL,17,Fand the Police and Crime Commissioner's
OL,18,Foffice.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
