OL,3,GNEWSAHate crime helpline on hand to
OL,4,Ahelp says council
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to Thames Valley Police's
OL,7,Fdata, there were 960 hate crimes in the
OL,8,FBerkshire West area, which includes
OL,9,FReading, between October 2025 and
OL,10,FSeptember. That was a slight decrease
OL,11,Ffrom 988 in the year before.
